  dcterms:description "FAIRified bird sighting and trait observations derived from the Birdsoftheworld-unprocessed dataset on Kaggle. The workflow includes repair of the source CSV, feature extraction from bird descriptions, normalization of trait values, semantic annotation and RDF transformation.";
